"content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "2000", "image": "", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Proceeding with our interview, I have a few more questions I would like to ask you.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Absolutely.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: What is your greatest strength?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: My writing skills. Having interned as a copy editor for the last two years, I have strong attention to detail when it comes to writing. I have also written for several publications, so I'm able to shape my writing style to suit my task and audience.<br />", "id": 1}, {"time": "31000", "image": "", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: What is your greatest weakness?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Organization has never been my strongest point. But I implemented a time management system that really helped my organizational skills.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: And how do you handle stress?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: That's a good question. I actually work better under pressure and have found I enjoy working in a challenging environment. As a social media writer and editor, I thrived under quick deadlines and multiple projects.<br />", "id": 2}, {"time": "61500", "image": "", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Great. only have two more questions for you. Why do you think you are the right person for this job?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I want this job because it seems tailored to my competencies, which include writing and editing. I understand that this company is on the way up. The website says the launch of several new books is imminent. I want to be part of this company as it grows.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: This is the last question, Ms. Lenard. What are your salary expectations?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: My  salary expectations are in line with my experience and qualifications.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: I think I have asked you everything. Thank you for coming in.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Thank you for interviewing me.<br />", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le16ob07re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}